<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Inference cost report, {{ report.window.since | moment }} to {{ report.window.until | moment }} UTC</title>
<style>
  /* One hue does all the encoding: the fill is the measured part, a lighter
     step of the same ramp is the rest. Text never wears it. */
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --page: #f9f9f7;
    --surface: #fcfcfb;
    --ink: #0b0b0b;
    --ink-2: #52514e;
    --rule: #e1e0d9;
    --border: rgba(11, 11, 11, 0.10);
    --fill: #2a78d6;
    --track: #cde2fb;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --page: #0d0d0d;
      --surface: #1a1a19;
      --ink: #ffffff;
      --ink-2: #c3c2b7;
      --rule: #2c2c2a;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
      --fill: #3987e5;
      --track: #0d366b;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--page);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }
  main { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 16px 64px; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  p { margin: 0; }
  .sub { color: var(--ink-2); }
  header { margin-bottom: 32px; }

  .hero { font-size: 56px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .hero small { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .lead { max-width: 62ch; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 17px; }

  .tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 32px 0 8px; }
  .tile { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; }
  .tile .label { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13px; }
  .tile .value { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; }
  .tile .detail { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13px; }

  section { margin-top: 40px; }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 12px; overflow-x: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
  th, td { padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; }
  /* Headers and long names wrap at their spaces and hyphens; values never break. */
  th { color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.3; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  td { white-space: nowrap; }
  td { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  tbody tr:first-child td { border-top: 0; }
  .n { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  td.name { white-space: normal; min-width: 11em; }
  tfoot td { font-weight: 600; }

  /* Meter: how much of a whole was used. Square at the baseline, rounded at the data end. */
  .gauge { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .meter { width: 96px; height: 8px; flex: none; background: var(--track); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
  .meter i { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--fill); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
  /* Bar: a share among peers. It grows from the left edge and has no track. */
  .bar { width: 96px; height: 8px; flex: none; }
  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; min-width: 2px; background: var(--fill); border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
  .gauge:hover i { filter: brightness(1.12); }
  .gauge .n { min-width: 4ch; }

  .key { display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .key span::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; margin-right: 6px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--fill); }
  .key .rest::before { background: var(--track); }

  dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 6px 24px; margin: 0; padding: 16px; }
  dt { color: var(--ink-2); }
  dd { margin: 0; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 18px; }
  footer { margin-top: 40px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 13px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>

<header>
  <h1>Inference cost report</h1>
  <p class="sub">{{ report.window.since | moment }} to {{ report.window.until | moment }} UTC</p>
</header>

{% if report.cost == 0 %}
<p class="lead">No telemetry was recorded in this window, so there is nothing to cost. Check that the collector is running and that the window covers a time the replicas were up.</p>
{% else %}
{% if report.cost_per_mtok is not none %}
<p class="hero">{{ report.cost_per_mtok | money }} <small>per million tokens</small></p>
<p class="lead">GPUs cost {{ report.cost | money }} in this window, and {{ report.idle_cost | money }} of it ({{ report.idle_share | percent }}) paid for time with nothing to serve. Without idle time the same tokens would have cost {{ report.active_cost_per_mtok | money }} per million.</p>
{% else %}
<p class="hero">{{ report.cost | money }} <small>spent, no tokens served</small></p>
<p class="lead">The GPUs were up for {{ report.gpu_hours | hours }} GPU-hours in this window and served no tokens through the gateway.</p>
{% endif %}

<div class="tiles">
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="label">GPU cost</div>
    <div class="value">{{ report.cost | money }}</div>
    <div class="detail">{{ report.gpu_hours | hours }} GPU-hours</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="label">Idle cost</div>
    <div class="value">{{ report.idle_cost | money }}</div>
    <div class="detail">{{ report.idle_share | percent }} of GPU cost</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="label">Idle GPU-hours</div>
    <div class="value">{{ report.idle_gpu_hours | hours }}</div>
    <div class="detail">of {{ report.gpu_hours | hours }}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tile">
    <div class="label">Tokens served</div>
    <div class="value">{{ report.tokens | compact }}</div>
    <div class="detail">{{ report.requests | count }} requests</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <h2>Cost by model</h2>
  <p class="sub">A model carries the cost of the replicas that serve it, idle time included.</p>
  <div class="key"><span>Active: GPUs doing work</span><span class="rest">Idle: paid for, nothing to serve</span></div>
  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Model</th>
          <th class="n">GPU-hours</th>
          <th class="n">Cost</th>
          <th>Active share</th>
          <th class="n">Idle cost</th>
          <th class="n">Idle GPU-hours</th>
          <th class="n">Prompt tokens</th>
          <th class="n">Completion tokens</th>
          <th class="n">Per million tokens</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for m in report.models %}
        <tr>
          <td class="name">{{ m.model or "(not reported)" }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.gpu_hours | hours }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.cost | money }}</td>
          <td>
            <div class="gauge" title="Active {{ m.active_cost | money }}, idle {{ m.idle_cost | money }}">
              <div class="meter" role="meter" aria-label="Active share of cost" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="{{ (m.active_share * 100) | round | int }}"><i style="width: {{ (m.active_share * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div>
              <span class="n">{{ m.active_share | percent }}</span>
            </div>
          </td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.idle_cost | money }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.idle_gpu_hours | hours }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.prompt_tokens | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.completion_tokens | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ m.cost_per_mtok | money }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Cost by tenant</h2>
  <p class="sub">Each replica's cost, idle time included, is split across its tenants by their share of the work.</p>
  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Tenant</th>
          <th>Model</th>
          <th class="n">Requests</th>
          <th class="n">Errors</th>
          <th class="n">Prompt tokens</th>
          <th class="n">Completion tokens</th>
          <th>Share of cost</th>
          <th class="n">Cost</th>
          <th class="n">Per million tokens</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for t in tenants %}
        {% set share = t.cost / report.cost %}
        <tr>
          <td>{% if t.tenant is none %}(no traffic to charge){% elif t.tenant == "" %}(no tenant header){% else %}{{ t.tenant }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td class="name">{{ t.model or "(not reported)" }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ t.requests | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ t.errors | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ t.prompt_tokens | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ t.completion_tokens | count }}</td>
          <td>
            <div class="gauge" title="{{ t.cost | money }} of {{ report.cost | money }}">
              <div class="bar"><i style="width: {{ (share * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div>
              <span class="n">{{ share | percent }}</span>
            </div>
          </td>
          <td class="n">{{ t.cost | money }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ t.cost_per_mtok | money }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
        {% if folded %}
        <tr>
          <td colspan="2">{{ folded_count | count }} smaller tenant rows</td>
          <td class="n">{{ folded.requests | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ folded.errors | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ folded.prompt_tokens | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ folded.completion_tokens | count }}</td>
          <td><div class="gauge"><div class="bar"><i style="width: {{ (folded.cost / report.cost * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div><span class="n">{{ (folded.cost / report.cost) | percent }}</span></div></td>
          <td class="n">{{ folded.cost | money }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ folded.cost_per_mtok | money }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
      </tbody>
      <tfoot>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="2">Total</td>
          <td class="n">{{ report.requests | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ report.tenants | sum(attribute="errors") | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ report.models | sum(attribute="prompt_tokens") | count }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ report.models | sum(attribute="completion_tokens") | count }}</td>
          <td></td>
          <td class="n">{{ report.cost | money }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ report.cost_per_mtok | money }}</td>
        </tr>
      </tfoot>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Replicas</h2>
  <p class="sub">A replica is billed from the first to the last sign of it in the window: its GPUs times the price, for every hour.</p>
  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Replica</th>
          <th>Host</th>
          <th>GPUs</th>
          <th class="n">Per GPU-hour</th>
          <th class="n">Hours seen</th>
          <th class="n">Cost</th>
          <th>Active share</th>
          <th>Active measured by</th>
          <th>Tenants split by</th>
          <th class="n">Requests traced</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for r in report.replicas %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ r.name }}</td>
          <td>{{ r.host or "(not set)" }}</td>
          <td>{{ r.gpu_count }} × {{ r.gpu_model }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ r.price_per_gpu_hour | money }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ r.hours | hours }}</td>
          <td class="n">{{ r.cost | money }}</td>
          <td>
            <div class="gauge" title="Active {{ r.active_cost | money }}, idle {{ r.idle_cost | money }}">
              <div class="meter" role="meter" aria-label="Active share of time" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="{{ (r.active_share * 100) | round | int }}"><i style="width: {{ (r.active_share * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div>
              <span class="n">{{ r.active_share | percent }}</span>
            </div>
          </td>
          <td class="name">{{ active_basis[r.active_basis] }}</td>
          <td class="name">{{ split_basis[r.split_basis] }}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if r.span_coverage is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ r.span_coverage | percent }}{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section>
  <h2>Telemetry level</h2>
  <p class="sub">How much the GPUs report about themselves. It decides how the active share above was measured; n/a marks a counter the host does not report.</p>
  <div class="card">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Host</th>
          <th>Level</th>
          <th>GPUs</th>
          <th class="n">Compute cores active</th>
          <th class="n">Tensor cores active</th>
          <th class="n">Memory bandwidth active</th>
          <th class="n">Busy time</th>
          <th class="n">Peak memory used</th>
          <th class="n">Average power</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for name, h in report.hosts %}
        <tr>
          <td>{{ name or "(not set)" }}</td>
          {% if h is none %}
          <td colspan="8" class="name">No GPU telemetry in this window. The active share comes from request timing.</td>
          {% else %}
          <td class="name"><strong>{{ levels[h.level][0] }}</strong>, {{ levels[h.level][1] }}</td>
          <td>{{ h.gpus }} × {{ h.gpu_models | join(", ") or "unnamed" }}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if h.sm_active is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ h.sm_active | percent }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if h.tensor_active is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ h.tensor_active | percent }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if h.dram_active is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ h.dram_active | percent }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if h.util is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ h.util | percent }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if h.memory_used_peak_bytes is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ h.memory_used_peak_bytes | gibibytes }}{% endif %}</td>
          <td class="n">{% if h.power_watts is none %}n/a{% else %}{{ h.power_watts | round | int }} W{% endif %}</td>
          {% endif %}
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <dl>
      <dt>Window</dt>
      <dd>{{ report.window.since | moment }} to {{ report.window.until | moment }} UTC ({{ report.window.seconds | span }})</dd>
      <dt>Generated</dt>
      <dd>{{ report.generated_at | moment }} UTC</dd>
      <dt>GPU prices</dt>
      <dd>{% for model, price in report.gpu_price_per_hour.items() %}{{ model }} at {{ price | money }} per GPU-hour{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}, from the config file</dd>
      <dt>Cost</dt>
      <dd>GPUs × price × hours seen. Idle hours are billed like any other.</dd>
      <dt>Active share</dt>
      <dd>Compute cores active where the host reports profiling counters; otherwise the share of time with at least one request in flight.</dd>
      <dt>Tenant split</dt>
      <dd>By engine time where spans report prefill and decode time, so prompt and completion tokens weigh what they took; otherwise by token count.</dd>
      {% if report.notes %}
      <dt>Notes</dt>
      <dd><ul>{% for note in report.notes %}<li>{{ note }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></dd>
      {% endif %}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>This report holds timings, token counts and dollars. No prompt or completion text is stored or shown.</footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
